From: friedger <friedger@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:33:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Private members file: GRASP-08 members re-read from
 NGIT_PRIVATE_MEMBERS_FILE

For deployments whose members live in an external registry (Belfry: the active
passes in Odoo). The file is re-read on the five-second membership
reconciliation and joined with NGIT_PRIVATE_MEMBERS; a malformed file keeps the
previous set.
